@startuml domain
title Current domain — menu, availability, and shopping list
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho

class Menu <<AggregateRoot>> {
  -_planning : Dict[TimeSlot, MealBlock]
  +add_mealblock(timeslot, mealblock)
  +is_stable() : bool
  +is_complete(expected_timeslots) : bool
  +get_unique_mealblocks() : list
}
class TimeSlot <<ValueObject>> {
  +day : str
  +meal_time : str
}
class MealBlock <<ValueObject>> {
  +recipe_snapshot : Recipe
  +length : int
}
class Recipe {
  +id : UUID
  +name : str
  +description : str
  +cooking_time : int
  +number_meals : int
}
class Ingredient {
  +id : UUID
  +name : str
  +standard_unit : Unit
}
enum Unit
class RecipeIngredient {
  +ingredient : Ingredient
  +unit : Unit
  +quantity : Decimal
}
class ShoppingListItem {
  +ingredient : Ingredient
  +unit : Unit
  +quantity : Decimal
}
class MealBlockGenerator <<DomainService>>
class MenuPlanner <<DomainService>>
class MenuEditor <<DomainService>>
class AvailableRecipeList
class RecipeExclusions
class UserExclusions
class SystemExclusions
class ShoppingListGenerator <<DomainService>>
interface RecipeRepository
interface RecipeIngredientRepository

Menu ..> TimeSlot : planning keys
Menu ..> MealBlock : planning values
MealBlock --> Recipe
MealBlockGenerator ..> MealBlock : creates
MenuPlanner ..> TimeSlot : receives ordered slots
MenuPlanner ..> MealBlock : receives blocks
MenuPlanner --> Menu : builds
MenuEditor --> Menu : modifies
MealBlockGenerator --> AvailableRecipeList
AvailableRecipeList --> RecipeRepository
AvailableRecipeList --> RecipeExclusions
RecipeExclusions --> UserExclusions
RecipeExclusions --> SystemExclusions
ShoppingListGenerator --> Menu
ShoppingListGenerator --> RecipeIngredientRepository
ShoppingListGenerator ..> RecipeIngredient : reads
ShoppingListGenerator ..> ShoppingListItem : creates
RecipeIngredient --> Ingredient
ShoppingListItem --> Ingredient
Ingredient --> Unit : standard unit
RecipeIngredient --> Unit : measured unit
ShoppingListItem --> Unit : output unit

note bottom of Menu
The planning is one mapping from TimeSlot keys to
MealBlock values, not two independent collections.
One MealBlock can occupy several keys according to its length.
is_stable() checks occurrence counts against block lengths;
is_complete(n) separately checks the planned slot count.
end note

note right of ShoppingListGenerator
Calls normalize_recipe_ingredient() from unit_conversion.py
before aggregating quantities by Ingredient.
end note
@enduml
